  "description": "The proposed change of use from a single family dwellinghouse (Use Class C3(a)) to a residential care home for two young people (Use Class C2).\nThere is no external structural changes or development  or works proposed .\n\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development would result in the loss of a single family dwellinghouse and would fail to demonstrate that it would meet identified local need. The application is therefore contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies SC1 and SC8.",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of a legal agreement, the development fails to secure a nomination agreement agreed with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies SC8 and IMP3.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed development would prejudice the safety of the local highway network, due to insufficient detail to preserve the highway network through the unacceptable number of proposed on-site car parking spaces, failing to ensure pedestrian safety and promote sustainable modes of transport contrary to adopted Local Plan Policy EC2."
  ],
